.TH IMCURVIN 1 "August 2026" "1.3.0" "imcurvin manual"
.SH NAME
imcurvin \- Advanced multi-vector vulnerability exploitation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B imcurvin
\-u <TARGET_URL> [OPTION]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B imcurvin
is an open-source web security auditing and MySQL injection POC framework featuring synchronized dual-vector parallel processing and high-concurrency layer bypass matrices.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-u, \-\-url <URL>
Specify the target website URL (Required).
.TP
.B \-tech, \-\-technique
Display advanced technical methodologies and framework configurations. User is very recommended to read this first.
.TP
.B \-rec, \-\-recon
Run environment reconnaissance.
.TP
.B \-shwpld, \-\-show-payload
Show payloads actively during execution.
.TP
.B \-val, \-\-validate
Enable post-scan Python validation engine for latency isolation.
.TP
.B \-cookie=<string>
Ingest custom session cookies (e.g., \-cookie="PHPSESSID=123").
.TP
.B \-valnow, \-\-validate-now
Validate the log file now.
.TP
.B \-skip
Skipping "Testing connection to target url" (TESTING).
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Display this help guide.
.SH YOU MAY ASK
.TP
.B Q: Why does this framework strictly depend on Stacked Queries and elevated database privileges?
ImCurvin heavily utilizes \fBprepared statements\fR for low-level execution mapping. In production environments, modern web applications rarely enable multi-statement execution (stacked queries) by default due to strict coding standards. 
.IP
This dependency acts as a practical filter to separate actual administrative testing from opportunistic threat vectors. While a malicious actor (black hat) might target blindly, a legitimate web security team or an authorized administrator (white hat) can explicitly configure these boundaries within a sandboxed environment to stress-test their infrastructure against the absolute worst-case exposure scenarios.
.TP
.B Q: Why are my time-based payloads getting dropped or giving false-negative anomalies?
If you are testing an environment that does not support stacked queries, multi-statement chains will fail silently at the database layer.
.IP
Additionally, if you want to verify and isolate true database delays from network jitter, you can activate the \fB\-val\fR flag during execution, or use \fB\-valnow\fR if you want to immediately validate your findings from the consolidated log files.
.SH FUN FACTS!
.IP "Fun Fact:"
Community testing has proven that the automated multi-port TOR routing within this framework remains highly resilient and extremely stable even under heavy concurrent traffic loads.
